"<tools>\n- read: Read file contents\n- bash: Execute bash commands (ls, grep, find, etc.)\n- agent_resume: Resume a restored subagent idle in its own session\n- agent_models: Discover subagent backends, model IDs, and Claude effort options\n- agent_spawn: Spawn background subagents (non-blocking) and manage them by id\n- team_create: Create a team of role-based background workers who message each other\n- team_succeed: Replace a team's ended coordinator or monitor\n- project_verbs: run, reload, inspect and tear down your own worktree's running copy of the project (up, apply, logs, status…)\n\nAdditional tools may be available.\n</tools>"
